    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "Returned runtime test (2026-08-10): even after changing the horse-drinking settings to make triggering much easier, autonomous drinking still did not visibly activate. The horse repeatedly lowered its head and sometimes pawed/digged at the ground, but it is unclear whether that is this feature or vanilla idle behavior. Treat this as failed/unproven, not accepted.\n\nRequired addition: a horse-specific water-source icon that is clearly water *for a horse*, not a generic human-drinkable water droplet. While the player is leading the owned horse, show these icons on nearby (~100 m) horse-drinkable objects such as troughs and water barrels; clear them immediately when no longer leading. Also document whether the settings hot-reload or require a restart, and ensure the diagnostics distinguish the mod's authored approach/drink scenario from vanilla idle head-lowering/pawing.",
